{"success":true,"site":"tmdb","sid":"movie/269149","tmdb_id":269149,"title":"疯狂动物城","original_title":"Zootopia","overview":"疯狂动物城是一座独一无二的现代动物都市。每种动物在这里都有自己的居所，比如富丽堂皇的撒哈拉广场，或者常年严寒的冰川镇。它就像一座大熔炉，动物们在这里和平共处——无论是大象还是小老鼠，只要你努力，都能在此闯出一番名堂。不过乐观的警官兔朱迪（金妮弗·古德温 配音）却发现，作为史上第一任兔子警官，要和一群强硬的大块头动物警察合作可不是件容易事。为了证明自己，她决心侦破一桩神秘案件；追寻真相的路上她被迫与口若悬河、谎技高超的狐尼克（杰森·贝特曼 配音）联手，却发现这桩案件背后隐藏着一个意欲颠覆动物城的巨大阴谋……","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6L0nYQqqEYPaSMjmsWH8dr8I4Sk.jpg","backdrop":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9tOkjBEiiGcaClgJFtwocStZvIT.jpg","release_date":"2016-02-11","year":"2016","runtime":"109 minutes","tmdb_rating_average":7.76,"tmdb_votes":18066,"tmdb_rating":"7.76 / 10 from 18066 users","genres":["动画","冒险","家庭","喜剧"],"languages":["English"],"countries":["United States of America"],"production_companies":["Walt Disney Animation Studios"],"directors":[{"name":"拜恩·霍华德","id":76595},{"name":"里奇·摩尔","id":165787}],"producers":[{"name":"克拉克·斯宾塞","id":69798}],"cast":[{"id":417,"name":"詹妮弗·古德温","original_name":"Ginnifer Goodwin","character":"Judy Hopps (voice)","image":"https://media.themoviedb.org/t/p/w300_and_h450_bestv2/n8XOnjgyfYvqRUDcnkAckRqSaNN.jpg"},{"id":23532,"name":"杰森·贝特曼","original_name":"Jason Bateman","character":"Nick Wilde (voice)","image":"https://media.themoviedb.org/t/p/w300_and_h450_bestv2/h6Sl1afuHMwnyqcxannecceIg4K.jpg"},{"id":17605,"name":"伊德瑞斯·艾尔巴","original_name":"Idris Elba","character":"Chief Bogo (voice)","image":"https://media.themoviedb.org/t/p/w300_and_h450_bestv2/be1bVF7qGX91a6c5WeRPs5pKXln.jpg"},{"id":213001,"name":"珍妮·斯蕾特","original_name":"Jenny Slate","character":"Bellwether (voice)","image":"https://media.themoviedb.org/t/p/w300_and_h450_bestv2/iNpXig5Djkh5moYG4TCekIATs5B.jpg"},{"id":41565,"name":"内特·托伦斯","original_name":"Nate Torrence","character":"Clawhauser (voice)","image":"https://media.themoviedb.org/t/p/w300_and_h450_bestv2/yT9o149xPygdY0NsF9sNgiQwuru.jpg"},{"id":5149,"name":"邦妮·亨特","original_name":"Bonnie Hunt","character":"Bonnie Hopps (vo